L20:  *     and both are reported side by side with the delta. A single window is never reported silently.
L21:  *   - Per question: callCount, the number of calls that did not reach an answer (idle calls), and the
L22:  *     largest SINGLE return in bytes - the "one read blows up the context" figure, not the total.
